\f1\b0 \cf0 In terms of Java classes, the shapes in the image are \'93DrawObjs\'94 (draw objects) and your image is embodied by a \'93Template\'94. For a shape to be recolored, it needs to be selected. You can select one or more shapes, or all the shapes in the Template. So first select the objects you want to recolor, then use one of the following methods to change its color.  (See \'93Selection Methods\'94)\
