\f0\b \cf3 Color Fundamentals (RGB versus CMYK):
\f1\b0 \cf0 \
The app is designed to make use of the full range of the RGB gamut, and so the app gamut is primarily intended for work that will be done on screen \'97 not printed. So the has some of the same weaknesses as every app that works with color on screen: the printed output is not the same as what you see on screen. There are inherent compromises involved, since the app is also designed for printed output (e.g., printed painting references). So the spacing of the hues is optimized for CMYK and does not have \'93perfect complements\'94 in the hue circle spacing. It\'92s designed to be useful, not mathematically perfect. xx :\
